    statement:"<p>Build an equation for a wave that fits all four clues. (1) Its maximum value is 5 and its minimum value is −1. (2) It has a maximum at `x = π/3`. (3) Its graph passes through (0, 2). (4) Its period is at least π. There’s more than one correct equation. How many can you find?</p>",
